      "width": 1060,
      "height": 70,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "Note:     \u2022 Provisioning WRITES to vault; no credential caching\n          \u2022 K8s mode: 9-stage pipeline (validate \u2192 namespace \u2192 CRD \u2192 ready \u2192 creds \u2192 backup \u2192 metrics \u2192 watcher \u2192 done)\n          \u2022 BYOC mode: skips pipeline, writes credentials directly and marks project ACTIVE\n          \u2022 PgDog picks up new cluster via NATS reload signal \u2014 no manual config changes",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "info",
      "originalText": "Note:     \u2022 Provisioning WRITES to vault; no credential caching\n          \u2022 K8s mode: 9-stage pipeline (validate \u2192 namespace \u2192 CRD \u2192 ready \u2192 creds \u2192 backup \u2192 metrics \u2192 watcher \u2192 done)\n          \u2022 BYOC mode: skips pipeline, writes credentials directly and marks project ACTIVE\n          \u2022 PgDog picks up new cluster via NATS reload signal \u2014 no manual config changes",
